{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/16/2523659/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おなかが痛くなったとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、なんかわからないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ごめんなさいっごめんなさいっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってめっちゃ 謝るよね！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、この話ですっごく盛り上がったんです( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中に神様がでてきて、その神様に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうしませんからー許してくださいー（ ;  ; ）って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ反省してめっちゃ言う（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、謝る内容は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜中にアイス食べちゃってごめんなさいとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手伝いせずにテレビ見てごめんなさいとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超くだらないことなんだよね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、あと、小さい頃、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は一人で廊下を歩くのが怖かったから、おっきな声で歌を歌ってごまかしてた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほとんどオリジナルの歌だったけど（笑）もお忘れちゃった(´,,^ω^,,`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、小さい頃のわたしには、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニャンちゅうの声がものすごく異様にこわかった（笑）（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなには、そおいうのある？？＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そおいえばこないだは三連休だったんだね～＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっかり忘れてたあ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなは楽しんだかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ秋らしい気温になってきたから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服買いにいかなきゃ┗(^o^ )┓<33"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりたいことが沢山あるんんんんんでっす！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはキリッと☆ミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/10/16/2523659/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答えるよっ（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  もしかして、さゆにゃん兄弟は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな運動が得意？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  お兄ちゃんたちは、野球、サッカー、バスケ、陸上...みんななんか色々やってたし、すごかったです(O_O)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、私には何故か なわとび を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"習わせた両親、グッジョブ( `^ω^)ｂ=3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日は朝早いので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人しく早寝します！(^-ω-^)Zzz.."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}